; SbDmaPagePorts                                 100000  96 PC, low confidence
; Sound Blaster 8237 DMA page register port for each channel 0-3
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SbDmaPagePorts:                                 ; Sound Blaster 8237 DMA page register port for each channel
