;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; SbDmaMaskPorts                                 100004  96 PC, low confidence
; Sound Blaster 8237 DMA single-channel mask register port for each channel
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SbDmaMaskPorts:                                 ; Sound Blaster 8237 DMA single-channel mask register port for
