;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; SbDmaCountPorts                                100014  96 PC, low confidence
; Sound Blaster 8237 DMA count register port for each channel
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SbDmaCountPorts:                                ; Sound Blaster 8237 DMA count register port for each channel;
